{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o155","title":"曹芳日食诏问得失蒋济上疏","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-46cc489f87a0b13f26db","label":"正文","text":"曹芳日食诏问得失蒋济上疏","evidence":["chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0129","role":"诏问得失","evidence":["chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"上疏责轻改法度","evidence":["chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2","source_order":[14,453,59],"order":3168}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0009","name":"蒋济","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0129","name":"曹芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-3a2b46a05a26ac9ea80b","layer":"original","quote":"是时，曹爽专政，丁谧、邓飏等，轻改法度。会有日食变，诏群臣问其得失。济上疏曰：“昔大舜佐治，戒在比周〖3〗；周公辅政，慎于其朋〖4〗；齐侯问灾〖5〗，晏婴对以布惠〖6〗；鲁君问异〖7〗，臧孙答以缓役〖8〗：应天塞变〖9〗，乃实人事。今二贼未灭，将士暴露已数十年；男女怨旷，百姓贫苦。夫为国法度，惟命世大才，乃能张其纲维以垂于后，岂中下之吏所宜改易哉！终无益于治，适足伤民。望宜使文武之臣，各守其职，率以清平；则和气祥瑞，可感而致也","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":274}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
